nav-item\"><a id=\"240613494\" data-name=\"anchor\" data-StClass=\"LuiAnchor\" href=\"#\">About Us</a></li><li id=\"126309882\" data-name=\"ourTeam\" data-StClass=\"LuiMenuItem\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"82716648\" data-name=\"anchor\" data-StClass=\"LuiAnchor\" href=\"#\">Our Team</a></li><li id=\"247078223\" data-name=\"carrers\" data-StClass=\"LuiMenuItem\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"19616113\" data-name=\"anchor\" data-StClass=\"LuiAnchor\" href=\"#\">Carrers</a></li></ul></li><li id=\"40301258\" data-name=\"contact\" data-StClass=\"LuiMenuItem\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"182375928\" data-name=\"anchor\" data-StClass=\"LuiAnchor\" href=\"#\">Contact</a></li></ul></nav>'.\n\n\"Parse HTML into an XML DOM tree\"\ndoc := XMLHTMLParser parse: htmlString.\n\n\"Serialize with pretty printing / indentation\"\nwriter := XMLWriter new.\nwriter enablePrettyPrinting.\ndoc printOn: writer.\nwriter contents."
